WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.669 --> 00:00:17.892
A fire warrior flew down and grabbed the salamander and the jar.

2
00:00:21.933 --> 00:00:26.255
salamander escaped from a pond in the Jade Emperor's garden," he explained.

3
00:00:26.275 --> 00:00:30.696
"The jar belongs to Laozi, but the salamander stole it.

4
00:00:31.388 --> 00:00:32.548
I'll bring them both back."

5
00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:38.630
The warrior flew back up into the clouds.

6
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:42.791
"Wow," Roxy said.

7
00:00:44.412 --> 00:00:45.252
People ran over.

8
00:00:45.272 --> 00:00:48.493
"Thank you for getting rid of the demon!"

9
00:00:48.893 --> 00:00:49.573
a woman said.

10
00:00:49.593 --> 00:00:52.374
"We live in a village near the mountain.

11
00:00:53.094 --> 00:00:54.854
Please join us for a feast."

12
00:00:57.395 --> 00:00:58.435
Bajie was drooling.

13
00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.541
"Yum—noodles, vegetables, and dumplings!"

14
00:01:03.561 --> 00:01:08.942
"We can finally have our picnic," Mara said happily.

15
00:01:08.962 --> 00:01:10.983
"Watch this."

16
00:01:11.783 --> 00:01:14.584
Bajie lifted a bowl of noodles and dumped them into his mouth.

17
00:01:15.844 --> 00:01:19.265
Gulp! "Bajie!"

18
00:01:19.705 --> 00:01:20.485
Wujing said.

19
00:01:20.505 --> 00:01:23.106
"You should be ashamed!"

20
00:01:25.687 --> 00:01:28.388
Bajie let out a huge burp, and Mara snorted.

21
00:01:30.996 --> 00:01:34.078
"I have a hard time being good too," Jack said to Wukong.

22
00:01:34.098 --> 00:01:36.439
"I can never sit still at school."

23
00:01:37.099 --> 00:01:37.960
Wukong grinned.

24
00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:43.143
"I got in big trouble with my teacher, Subodhi, a long time ago.

25
00:01:45.464 --> 00:01:47.805
You should try meditating—it helps me to stay calm."

26
00:01:49.346 --> 00:01:52.248
Wukong showed Jack how to close his eyes and breathe slowly.

27
00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:59.532
Suddenly Jack felt himself floating, and his eyes flew open.

28
00:02:00.972 --> 00:02:02.273
"Whoa!" Jack said.

29
00:02:02.293 --> 00:02:05.114
"I'm flying—like Rocket Girl!"

30
00:02:05.134 --> 00:02:08.056
"It's magic!"

31
00:02:08.456 --> 00:02:10.538
Wukong laughed and lowered Jack back down.

32
00:02:12.959 --> 00:02:18.442
"Roxy," Terrell asked quietly, "is this the world where you were when you were missing?"

33
00:02:19.523 --> 00:02:20.223
Roxy nodded.

34
00:02:20.243 --> 00:02:23.485
"I was stuck here fighting that demon for a while."

35
00:02:23.505 --> 00:02:28.288
"I wish I could have helped you," Terrell said.

36
00:02:29.588 --> 00:02:31.209
"I don't think you could have helped, Terrell.

37
00:02:31.689 --> 00:02:33.629
The demon was really powerful."

38
00:02:33.649 --> 00:02:38.250
"Excuse me, Rocket Girl," Wujing interrupted.

39
00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:42.632
"Can you teach me how to shoot fire from my eyes before you leave?"

40
00:02:42.652 --> 00:02:44.412
"I can try."

41
00:02:47.473 --> 00:02:51.874
As Roxy and Wujing wandered away from the table, Terrell let out a deep sigh.

42
00:02:54.695 --> 00:02:56.376
The Tang Monk sat down beside him.

43
00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:57.636
"What's wrong?"

44
00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:03.962
"I want to help Rocket Girl, but I don't have any super powers," Terrell said.

45
00:03:03.982 --> 00:03:07.704
"I don't have super powers either," the Tang Monk said.

46
00:03:07.724 --> 00:03:10.205
"But that doesn't mean I can't help my friends.

47
00:03:12.126 --> 00:03:15.847
Wukong, Bajie, and Wujing committed terrible crimes long ago.

48
00:03:17.148 --> 00:03:19.569
Now I'm helping them to be good and earn forgiveness.

49
00:03:20.469 --> 00:03:23.050
I'm sure you'll eventually find a way to help your friend."

50
00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:25.851
"I hope so."

51
00:03:26.552 --> 00:03:29.013
Terrell nodded, but he still felt uncertain.

52
00:03:30.154 --> 00:03:32.276
He'd tried to help Roxy many times before.

53
00:03:35.238 --> 00:03:39.041
At last it was time for the Tang Monk and his companions to continue their journey.

54
00:03:39.862 --> 00:03:41.183
Wukong opened the portal.

55
00:03:41.203 --> 00:03:45.826
"Good-bye!" everyone said.

56
00:03:49.369 --> 00:03:50.770
Roxy smiled at Wukong.

57
00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.632
"Be good!"

58
00:04:09.136 --> 00:04:09.396
"Hey, guys!"

59
00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:11.017
Roxy found her friends in Metro City Park.

60
00:04:12.197 --> 00:04:13.217
Jack raised an eyebrow.

61
00:04:13.237 --> 00:04:15.218
"How did you know we were here?"

62
00:04:16.478 --> 00:04:17.238
Roxy gulped.

63
00:04:17.258 --> 00:04:20.259
"Oh no," she thought.

64
00:04:20.279 --> 00:04:21.979
"What should I say?"

65
00:04:21.999 --> 00:04:26.581
"I texted her," Terrell blurted out.

66
00:04:26.601 --> 00:04:33.062
"Yeah, I talked to Roxy earlier, and she said she was away, visiting family.

67
00:04:34.003 --> 00:04:36.583
She just got back, so I told her to come and meet us here."

68
00:04:37.844 --> 00:04:38.484
Roxy nodded.

69
00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.161
"Yep, that's right!"

70
00:04:41.322 --> 00:04:44.185
She shot Terrell a look that silently said, "thank you."

71
00:04:45.146 --> 00:04:47.348
A big smile formed across Terrell's face.

72
00:04:47.368 --> 00:04:50.351
"Roxy," Mara said.

73
00:04:50.371 --> 00:04:53.874
"We have a huge story to tell you."

74
00:04:54.935 --> 00:04:56.177
Jack nodded excitedly.

75
00:04:56.197 --> 00:04:59.340
"You won't believe what you missed!"
